      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© Crown copyright 2017.",
        "AbstractText": "Haemophilus influenzae is an important human pathogen that primarily infects small children. In recent years, H. influenzae serotype a has emerged as a significant cause of invasive disease among indigenous populations. Here, we present the first complete whole-genome sequence of H. influenzae serotype a."
